i": "https://scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75312297_643955654606405_480568527955268312_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=eLpeA4FXlbwQ7kNvwH9dqbi&_nc_oc=AdrSRRDiBvVsJwgrR56Hx1LoF1btwa1CfAHsURBgv3trha7SNUpm7ULRvbhkN4SOKLI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9pVumbIwDgE2EQKFuSJ4GDJc6V8IcHmbx9P7ecRM95mQ&oe=6A394FE6"}, {"file_name": "Master.00_00_34_53.Still005.png", "id": "868776144968854", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57574721_868776148302187_2395318248093284663_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=OXQlVHXg3pMQ7kNvwFKYSHE&_nc_oc=AdpZtH8LsVCRZbs6EkmqoqtuCj9V9M2XRNx70zlNVtwPUvmpiZtTLAHeQiKurOVQVRQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-_LrbhFjoUcxSaGjhJ87263VE3MSgq5kPKDtvyESp6UQ&oe=6A394532"}, {"file_name": "Master.00_00_25_53.Still002.png", "id": "692760662818107", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982461_692760666151440_1673600769700015261_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=kGJ7BDYZp0sQ7kNvwGZz5VT&_nc_oc=AdpcCaQcOpUL7kX2SnPCyReDYuGG9Tm0y6IWVuCj7s6cwUXuf8GVF1Sxq7-V6ccNWPU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-6M47xCHVxnvdAjhUyjQXteLcyLDhNReJRG-Q7MsL2GA&oe=6A393EFB"}, {"file_name": "2023-07-01 19-38-56.mp4.00_05_33_04.Still001.png", "id": "1014728119759484", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974571_1014728126426150_3738956639406327634_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=cw4weCkEIYAQ7kNvwF6eKAG&_nc_oc=Adp36Gbw42u-4yEGGG7dIglmFYDq_MCIiw0A6XYTYShrHh9rS0m_ePtxAHyAQEDBzJs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8M45ef0iWhytRs96oJh7DQ-OXg0en4WBhZm5mKPInqyQ&oe=6A395473"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Trailer_End_Card-Recovered.png", "id": "273391962004750", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974788_273391965338083_1886064065722113930_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=omdJlpGb0ZAQ7kNvwEMwTht&_nc_oc=AdoPhsLVNVMd-Nz3IgqQM2ifHf8AWKJdCNJjo4SQqcKmNkyYvcdPfA_I306Cfw3ckaI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8pgu533WIsVnOMuTCr6b-CuWBvULvUf2JZhNQoQ_FaZg&oe=6A395272"}, "display_name": "Ziggy's Cosmic Adventures", "keywords": ["Cockpit", "Alien", "Green", "Space", "Physics"], "long_description": "Ziggy's Cosmic Adventures is a VR cockpit game combining ship management with action-arcade combat. You play as a (sometimes effective) bounty hunter with possibly questionable morals, currently in possession of a powerful little alien that you may or may not have stolen/liberated from the evil Empire. As the Empire closes in, you'll need to find a way to balance your ship's management with the onslaught of attacks. Do you have what it takes to survive?\n\n\u2022 Become one with the ship: Immerse yourself in a cockpit packed full from ceiling to floor with distinct physics-based interactions (Though make sure to keep your eye on them all if you want to survive!).\n\n\u2022 Rebel against The Empire: Engage in thrilling dogfights as squads of enemies pursue you to re-capture the small green treasure aboard your ship - shoot bullets, launch bombs, and raise your shields. It's going to get bumpy!\n\n\u2022 Navigate the vacuum of space: Control the ship with a radical and easy-to-use virtual flight stick design, dodge your way through hazardous space environments, and don't forget to do a barrel roll!\n\n\u2022 The little guy: Who could forget your cosmic friend, Ziggy?! This mysterious creature is a perfect fuel source. You can also play with them, use them as a resource, feed them, and most importantly pet them!\n\n\u2022 The Journey: Fight your way through 13 unique levels total. Forge a different path each time by beating challenges and unlocking harder worlds en route.", "short_description": "Ziggy's Cosmic Adventures is a VR cockpit game combining ship management with action-arcade combat. You play as a (sometimes effective) bounty hunter with possibly questionable morals, currently in possession of a powerful little alien that you may or may not have stolen/liberated from the evil Empire. As the Empire closes in, you'll need to find a way to balance your ship's management with the onslaught of attacks. Do you have what it takes to survive?"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Ziggy_Monoscopic.png", "id": "1296582511245835", "image_type": "APP_IMG_CUBEMAP_SOURCE", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974446_1296582517912501_8438674573824683709_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=pxcdWN0G72AQ7kNvwHtCKtD&_nc_oc=Adr3DOlC5z5DLQWoggoCoXZKkyHg1tF3tU5E9Ivc3UOCqir7esGTZ9VYM179uviVNzg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-JdqatFDqUDcaelrBoSaHxYghHMniQuMQwyjoWLtJ6KQ&oe=6A3949D3"}, {"file_name": "CoverSquare.png", "id": "1124369782419830", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39036658_1124369785753163_6062844584904789074_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=VWVpz5KxhXYQ7kNvwF5Vf6F&_nc_oc=AdqxI5GLlJ6dxLo01fgtX8I_459MfguQZsSPnujcBFJ4zqjShysBlmzyz7fl9CQaqP8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8Ihoweip7d4ojDNKbe2ABw8q1AXenzJxH2V_vH752iuw&oe=6A3945EF"}, {"file_name": "Icon_v1.png", "id": "1106448921139578", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001696_1106448927806244_1890053882317213161_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=uW13wfkkKicQ7kNvwH33mMm&_nc_oc=AdoQ-i-YF7hbys-x7SMOT0YPBIbnAkSodq3ywFmDR_VW5QWILCHlASuTcC4xoMDX2F0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9dTm6_aWsyjia9j2KcOLJReOHyG8bEYJZ405hohhHapg&oe=6A3951A2"}, {"file_name": "Logo.png", "id": "973425620588096", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/86610716_973425627254762_